  "long": "Works with the attachments of a space.\n\nPage bodies refer to attachments by the path `/attachments/{ID}` (e.g. `![diagram](/attachments/01234567-89ab-cdef-0123-456789abcdef)`).\nTo check a diagram or screenshot in a body, pass that ID to `wikino attachment get` and save the file locally.",
