      "default": "",
      "description": "Space identifier (space)",
      "name": "space",
      "shorthand": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "long": "Remove saved credentials (the token and the configured combination).\n\nThe target is decided in the same order as other commands.\n`<space>` means the same as `--space`.\nWhen the space has credentials for several members, choose one with `--member`.\n\nCredentials from a browser login are removed after their refresh token is revoked on the server.\nIf revocation fails (for example, the host is unreachable), the local credentials are still removed and a warning is printed to stderr.\nIn that case, disconnect the app on Wikino's connected apps page.\n\nPersonal access tokens are not revoked on the server.\nTo make a token unusable, delete it in the space settings.\nA token in `WIKINO_TOKEN` is not saved, so it is not a target of this command.\n\nRemoving the default combination clears the default.",
  "output": "  Prints the removed credentials with the same fields as `wikino auth login`. default and space_default are the values before removal.",
  "short": "Remove saved credentials",
  "subcommands": [],
  "usage": "wikino auth logout [<space>] [flags]"
}

