    },
    {
      "default": "",
      "description": "Space identifier (space)",
      "name": "space",
      "shorthand": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "long": "For each saved credential, fetch and print the host, space, member, and the token's kind, scopes, and expiry from the API.\n\nWith `--host`, `--space`, or `--member`, only matching credentials are printed.\nWhen a token is given in `WIKINO_TOKEN`, that token is checked instead of saved credentials (`--space` or `WIKINO_SPACE` is required).\n\nUse this before an operation to check that the token has the scopes it needs.\nWhether an operation is allowed also depends on the member's permissions, not only the scopes.",
  "output": "  Prints `{\"items\": [...]}` with these fields per credential.\n    host, space, member, default, space_default  Same as `wikino auth login`\n    token_store  Where the token is saved (keyring, file, or env for `WIKINO_TOKEN`)\n    token        Token information (kind, scopes, expires_at). null when it could not be fetched\n    error        Why it could not be fetched (code, message, hint, status). Omitted on success",
  "short": "Check credentials and tokens",
  "subcommands": [],
  "usage": "wikino auth status [flags]"
}

