  "examples": "  # Show page 12\n  wikino page get 12\n\n  # Write page 12 to a file as Markdown in the Wikino file format\n  wikino page get 12 --md > page-12.md\n\n  # Print only the version (ETag) of page 12\n  wikino page get 12 --jq .etag",
