  "long": "Lists the pages that the body of the specified page points to with wiki links, most recently updated first.\nThese are the same pages as the list of links shown below the page on the web.\n\nOnly links in the published body count; links only in a draft are not included.\nLink targets not yet published, such as pages created automatically by wiki links, are included with `status` set to `unpublished`.\nPages in the trash and pages in private topics you cannot see are not included.\n\nTo find the pages that link to this page instead, use `wikino page backlinks`.\n\nThe output format and paging are the same as `wikino page list`.\nThe list does not include page bodies; it includes an excerpt of the beginning of the body (`excerpt`) instead.",
  "output": "  Like `wikino page list`, prints `{\"items\": [...], \"next_cursor\": ...}`.\n  See the help of `wikino page list` for the fields of each page.\n  `excerpt` is not part of the API response; the CLI builds it from the body. `body` is printed only when included in `--fields`.\n  With `--all`, prints JSON Lines where each line is one item, without `next_cursor`.\n  When the page links to nothing, returns an empty list with exit code 0.",
  "short": "List the pages a page links to",
  "subcommands": [],
  "usage": "wikino page links <page_number> [flags]"
}

