  "long": "Manage the skill for coding agents (such as Claude Code).\n\nThe skill describes Wikino's concepts and has a guide for each situation: finding and reading pages, writing pages, publishing drafts, and logging in.\nAgents read the skill to learn how to use this CLI and what to watch out for.\nThe skill is embedded in this CLI's binary, so the skill you install matches the version of the CLI.",
  "output": "  See the help of each subcommand.",
  "short": "Manage the skill for coding agents",
