  "long": "Write the skill embedded in this CLI (SKILL.md and the guides) to `wikino/` under a skills directory.\n\nBy default, it is written to Claude Code's user-level skills directory (`$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/skills/`, or `~/.claude/skills/` if unset).\nTo use it with another agent, give the directory that agent reads skills from with `--dir`.\nA repository's `.claude/skills/` holds the skills for developing that repository, so it is not the default.\n\nThe skill is written in the display language (`WIKINO_LANG`, `LC_ALL`, `LC_MESSAGES`, `LANG`), and in English for languages other than Japanese.\nSkill files already in `wikino/` are overwritten, and other files are kept.\nAfter updating the CLI, run this again to update the skill too.",
  "output": "  Prints the following fields for the installed skill.\n    path   The directory of the installed skill (`wikino/` under `--dir`)\n    lang   The language of the installed skill (ja, en)\n    files  The names of the written files",
  "short": "Install the skill",
  "subcommands": [],
  "usage": "wikino skill install [flags]"
}

